    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0108_9ce9aaa536db.png\" style=\"width: 362px; height: 202px;\" />&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi>rg</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;........<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi>rg</mi></msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ..........<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>732</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
